{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55317","headline":"周世宗时被召作（题拟） · 陈抟","name":"周世宗时被召作（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"草泽吾皇诏，图南抟姓陈。\n三峰十年客。\n四海一闲人。\n世态从来薄，诗情自得真。\n超然居物外，何必使爲臣。\n（见陶岳《五代史补》卷五。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈抟","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55317.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55317","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}